Modifications: only Rondônia's features are read (the Legal Amazon's
other states are not). Of the yearly increments, every feature of the
class DESMATAMENTO (all of them, here) is kept with its PRODES year, its
image date and its area in km²; of the mask, each polygon's area. The
other attributes are not kept. Each outline is repaired where it is
invalid and simplified by about 55 m (0.0005 degrees), keeping its
topology, and its coordinates rounded to four decimal places, as
published. 634 slivers (448 of the increments, 186 of the mask), pieces
cut at a satellite scene's edge that have no area left once their
outline is repaired, are left out: 0.0519 km² in all by the published
areas, the largest 0.0026 km². 162 small polygons that the
simplification would have erased though they have an area are kept with
their published outline. A PRODES year runs from August to July; the map's timeline
places each increment on the 31 July its year ends. The map's third
layer counts the increments into hexagons.


